Implemented the complete tracking, SEO, RecipeGuide, Apps Script, attribution, and disclaimer brief.

Key outcomes:

- Content-driven GA4, Clarity, Meta Pixel, TikTok Pixel, and site-verification tags.
- New delegated event and UTM attribution layer.
- Campaign data added to booking submissions and WhatsApp links.
- Token-protected Apps Script lead reading and status updates.
- Generated `robots.txt`, `agents.txt`, `.nojekyll`, `CNAME`, root `404.html`, and verification files.
- `/RecipeGuide/` is now the landing page.
- `/RecipeGuide/free/` contains the existing 60-recipe guide.
- Public disclaimer text removed or neutralised as specified.
- Temporary tracking IDs were tested, then restored to empty.
- Local server was stopped after curl verification.

Final verification:

```text
La Rose — built 346 pages
Validated 346 pages
0 errors, 0 warnings
```

Full file-by-file report: [CODEX-TRACKING-REPORT.md](</Users/maged/Desktop/new/website data/new site/_project/CODEX-TRACKING-REPORT.md>)
